# The engine inside the app: the Full ensemble on its own seed, 128 bars in windows of 240 ticks, rendered by the
# app's engine (in the pool) as the transport will render it, gives Berlinan's notes. The count and the notes-hash
# (FNV-1a 64 over the N lines) are what tests/host/equiv_test.c prints for tests/equiv/live_selfrender.script.
selfrender full 128
expect selfnotes 2816
expect selfhash_hi 0x6efc6f44
expect selfhash_lo 0xce4d343d
